# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). For a trial room lived through (now the sfx `unlock` and `levelUp`, game/trials.js).
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
title    Trial
composer Claude
about    A memory lived through: the title's rocking crystal ostinato and its toy tune, whole (A B C, E D, C), quietly over glass harmonica chords and a fretless bass, a glass tap and a singing bowl, ending on the bird's wide call.
tempo    100
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.5

# mood explore: lead ost bird harm bass bowl tap

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.75 pan=-0.1
voice ost      crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3 oct=1
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.75
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.24 pan=0.2  center=A4 att=0.2 rel=1
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.6
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.35 pan=0.1  rev=0.6
voice tap      glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.35

# Am Am F: the toy tune whole, ending on the call
pattern lived
lead    | A4--- B4- C5----- | E5----- D5----- | C5----------- |
ost     | A2!- A2- B2- A2!- A2- B2- | % | F2!- F2- G2- F2!----- |
bird    | _ | _ | .----- A6 A5+B5---- |
harm    | [Am]?----------- | % | [F]----------- |
bass    | C2----- A1----- | C2----- B1----- | A1----------- |
bowl    | _ | _ | F3----------- |
tap     | x.o... ...... | x.o... ...... | X..... ...... |

loop lived
